(I) using an incorrect or irrelevant taxpayer registration number;
(2) Issuing invalid invoices or sales receipts;
(3) Issuing invalid credit notes or creditor notes;
(4) Invoice; Receipt Failure to provide or fail to p rovide credit notes or creditor notes in accordance with any tax law.
